ji": "Tousan no Kiteki", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Yu Sakai, the composer and singer of the song, found his 4th grade diary at his parents' house. Within the pages he recounted how scary his fisherman father was. As an adult, it seems like every time Sakai returns home, his father's back seems smaller and smaller.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 117395, "title": {"romaji": "Harukana Receive: Yokoku", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Web-exclusive next episode previews for Harukana Receive. These contain unique chibi animations and are released on Kadokawa's official YouTube channel. They are released about 2 days prior to the full episode airing.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 9}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 11, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sports"], "tags": [{"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Flash", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Chibi", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 117398, "title": {"romaji": "Puchimas!: PETIT IDOLM@STER (OVA)", "english": null}, "format": "OVA", "description": "OVAs bundled with the limited editions of volumes 10 and 11 of the manga.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 11}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 2, "duration": 11, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Music", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 117960, "title": {"romaji": "Cogimyun", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The series centers on the flour dough spirit <i>Cogimyun</i>, who actually really wants to be an onigiri. She takes care of her grandfather's apartment complex due to her grandfather being away. The denizens of the apartment are all \"Kogimuko,\" which are all food that center on flour dough.\n<br><br>\n(Source: AnimeNewsNetwork)", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2017, "episodes": 24, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Food", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kids", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 118124, "title": {"romaji": "Destiny Child", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The devil king Lucifero suddenly declares he's going to retire, and must choose a successor. The Devil King Cadets gather one after another, and go to the human world to participate in the succession contest. But only the devil king's own descendant Osamu has no interest whatsoever in the contest. Compared to the fate of the world, Osamu is more interested in his part-time job at a convenience store. Osamu has no choice, however, but to start collecting familiars called \"Child,\" which are born from human souls. Osamu still only has an interest in his part-time job, and he's a few steps behind the rest of the Cadets.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 1, "duration": 26, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Demons", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 118567, "title": {"romaji": "Banana ga Suki", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "A short music video for Yano Akiko & Yuki's song <i>Banana ga Suki</i>. It promotes the single's release in 2 weeks and the video was posted to Victor Entertainment's official YouTube channel.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 10}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Aliens", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Food", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 119085, "title": {"romaji": "Kaijuu shinwa", "english": "Quest of the Battling Gods"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "In the moments before death, one of the Battling Gods recalls his defeat in a magnificent fight. That battle transcended meta worlds, time and parallel universes as the Battling God faced off with another of his kind. All living creatures celebrated their fight with cries of joy.\n<br><br>\nGraduate Work 2018, Tokyo University of the Arts, Graduate School of Film and New Media, Department of Animation.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 13, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy", "Mystery", "Psychological"], "tags": [{"name": "Kaiju", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 119354, "title": {"romaji": "Morimori Shima no Mogu to Perol", "english": "Mogu&Perol"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A story about two friends living on an island delicious food can be found everywhere. Mogu is a born chef and Perol loves to eat.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 8, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Fairy Tale", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Food", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Rural", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Stop Motion", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 119368, "title": {"romaji": "LayereD Stories 0", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "In Shibuya, Tokyo in 2037, LayereD is a platform that uses mixed reality technology to create visualizations of the Internet in the real world. By using special devices, people can have various augmented-reality experiences. Users are able to bring things they imagine into the real world, allowing for a wide variety of self-expression. However, the system does not provide people the freedom it was supposed to, and people actually live in an oppressive society. In the Varna Counter system, harmful creations are eliminated in order to make LayereD \"completely clean and healthy.\" Because users monitor each other to maintain regulations, society becomes rigid and constrained.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 3}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 9, "duration": 17, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sci-Fi"], "tags": []}, {"id": 119533, "title": {"romaji": "Yoru ni Natta Yuki noHanashi", "english": "A Snowflake into the Night"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "One day,\nthe snow metamorphosed into an earthworm, when it sensed danger for melting.\nThe earthworm, who longed for aboveground, metamorphosed into a tree.\nIt continues metamorphosing and....\nSomeday, it will remember her old self.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Stop Motion", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 119535, "title": {"romaji": "Mimi", "english": "Mimi"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": 